{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Locked Together is a horror experience inspired by escape rooms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is divided into levels, each offering a unique mini-adventure with different environments, items, puzzles, and entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/levelsGif.gif?t=1746519698\" />Face the challenge alone or with friends in co-op. Solve the puzzles and find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/CoopGif.gif?t=1746519698\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examine and interact with items as you try to unravel the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/ItemsGif.gif?t=1746519698\" />If you'd like to be part of the development process or or stay updated with the latest news, join the <strong>Discord</strong>. Every type of feedback is appreciated!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507220?t=1746519698","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507220?t=1746519698","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/d84c9617f32ee695e0f6d9ff182849656a11d80e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746519698","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/d84c9617f32ee695e0f6d9ff182849656a11d80e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746519698","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes"